[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 913.509, "timestamp": "00:15:13", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 917.67, "timestamp": "00:15:17", "text": "不错。 好的。 你好。 所以，呃，我，我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 922.15, "timestamp": "00:15:22", "text": "我失去了勇气，你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 925.189, "timestamp": "00:15:25", "text": "用我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 928.79, "timestamp": "00:15:28", "text": "平常的生活去适应这个模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 931.03, "timestamp": "00:15:31", "text": "嗯，因为，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 934.47, "timestamp": "00:15:34", "text": "呃，再说一遍，呃，如果事情发生了，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 936.79, "timestamp": "00:15:36", "text": "发生了什么事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 940.069, "timestamp": "00:15:40", "text": "那就顺其自然吧。 但就目前来看，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 943.91, "timestamp": "00:15:43", "text": "觉得短期内不会发生这种情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 946.629, "timestamp": "00:15:46", "text": "。 所以我打算用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 949.269, "timestamp": "00:15:49", "text": "我用了大概四"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 952.31, "timestamp": "00:15:52", "text": "两年的旧型号，对吧[笑声]。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 955.11, "timestamp": "00:15:55", "text": "所以从接下来的三个月开始，我打算就用它。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 957.03, "timestamp": "00:15:57", "text": "我现在就可以换到"}]